tolome-artwork (0.4.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * GRUB of the installed system while "Loading Linux": GRUB_BACKGROUND is now
    a flat indigo (#23325E) image without logo, so the console background is
    indigo and no second, offset logo appears. The theme logo is fixed-size and
    moved to the top of the screen, out of the console area, and the theme gets
    a flat desktop-image (avoids the UEFI "null src bitmap" error).

 -- Anhky <dev@tolome.net>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0100

tolome-artwork (0.3.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add the provisional login sound (sounds/accueil.wav, CC-BY-SA-4.0) played
    once at each GNOME login with pw-play, at stream volume 0.7. Not played in
    the live session, nor when GNOME event sounds are disabled. It can be
    disabled from GNOME Tweaks (startup applications) or with a hidden
    autostart override. The sound is replaced by changing a single file.
  * Install sounds/son-accueil.py as an example, add tests/test-login-sound.sh.

 -- Anhky <dev@tolome.net>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0100

